Subject: [PATCH 11/11] Keep legal comments in the standalone bundle

Vite defaults esbuild's legalComments to "none", which drops the third-party license notices from the minified player.
---
 vite.config.ts | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/vite.config.ts b/vite.config.ts
index 4ff3f8d..ec23bb9 100644
--- a/vite.config.ts
+++ b/vite.config.ts
@@ -46,6 +46,9 @@ export default defineConfig(({ command, mode }) => {
                 ).toISOString(),
             ),
         },
+        esbuild: {
+            legalComments: "inline",
+        },
         build: {
             outDir: "dist",
             copyPublicDir: false, // Disables the copying of public/ directory during build
